38qEl6A","date":"2021-03-06T04:06:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9248404502868652,"text_excerpt":"I love this PJ's coffee location. It is next to City Park Physical Therapy off of Canal. They are always extremely friendly and actually remember me when I come in. It has very comfy leather couches and plenty of booth and table seating. I completely spazzed out one day and dumped my entire mocha on the floor - which was embarrassing and horrible. They quickly mopped it up and provided me with another free of charge. Even the other patrons were kind - helping me clean up the mess and making me feel better with jokes! Gotta love NOLA"},{"business_id":"rZm_ttIRjTaQyVmD-Rk55A","review_id":"yj4rWD26DXAmtsq5vZBQZA","date":"2021-02-10T03:55:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9236157536506653,"text_excerpt":"This is my favorite PJ's location. Yes, I know it's a chain in a town full of unique possibilities, but none of those small businesses are open before this teacher has to get to work!!!! Pjs is still a local choice no matter what anyone says. THIS PHS, is awesome because it has a spacious patio to spread out on (COVID times) and some open booths and tables inside (appropriately spaced). If you're REALLY lucky, you can snag the secret booth between the bathrooms and the main dining room The girls that work here really are the reason for the 5 stars. They go above and beyond every. single. day. to make sure everyone in that line feels special. They will gladly remake your coffee until it is..."},{"business_id":"rZm_ttIRjTaQyVmD-Rk55A","review_id":"pmD0jWEtq3X8uJj-GFOpvQ","date":"2018-06-18T20:10:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9219421148300171,"text_excerpt":"PJ's Coffee is a must have when in New Orleans. It's my first time at this location and I came here out of convenience. But I must say that it is spacious, clean, and fairly quiet. The barista was very gracious as she took and prepared my order. The coffee is as good as ever and the ham and cheese croissant was tasty. The atmosphere too is comfortable with people working on their laptops or carrying on a conversation."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"rZm_ttIRjTaQyVmD-Rk55A","photo_id":"uG4Q-2vXmr0jOW8AtiWoTw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/uG4Q-2vXmr0jOW8AtiWoTw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9308035969734192},{"business_id":"rZm_ttIRjTaQyVmD-Rk55A","photo_id":"BtQ-SQYBZ288wO0bZMhbtg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/BtQ-SQYBZ288wO0bZMhbtg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8565710783004761},{"business_id":"rZm_ttIRjTaQyVmD-Rk55A","photo_id":"H-KgeF-bqoW-opvfpzqxeA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/H-KgeF-bqoW-opvfpzqxeA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8359297513961792},{"business_id":"rZm_ttIRjTaQyVmD-Rk55A","photo_id":"zeYyaQmkfmEGEH8nXPYeFA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/zeYyaQmkfmEGEH8nXPYeFA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8203879594802856},{"business_id":"rZm_ttIRjTaQyVmD-Rk55A","photo_id":"HgZoZzutln1gbPBAhnI9Ww","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HgZoZzutln1gbPBAhnI9Ww.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8080641031265259}]},"notebook_case":null}
